---
// How It Works - Interactive 3-step section
---

<section class="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Process</span>
      <h2>How It Works in 3 Steps</h2>
      <p>Get studio-quality visuals faster than traditional photography.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">01</span>

        <h3>Upload &amp; brief</h3>
        <p>Share your product photo and a quick brief about your vision. Takes 5 minutes.</p>

        <div class="step-details">
          <ul>
            <li>Upload product photos</li>
            <li>Describe your style</li>
            <li>Select angles &amp; options</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">02</span>

        <h3>We generate</h3>
        <p>Our AI creates variations in your brand aesthetic. Full turnaround: 24–48 hours.</p>

        <div class="step-details">
          <ul>
            <li>AI processes your brief</li>
            <li>Generates variations</li>
            <li>Quality check</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number">03</span>

        <h3>Download &amp; use</h3>
        <p>High-res files ready for your storefront, ads, social — everything you need.</p>

        <div class="step-details">
          <ul>
            <li>Download high-res files</li>
            <li>Multiple formats</li>
            <li>Use everywhere</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="timeline-bar">
      <div class="timeline-segment">
        <span class="timeline-label">Upload</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-segment active">
        <span class="timeline-label">24-48h</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-segment">
        <span class="timeline-label">Download</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <div class="benefits-grid">
      <div class="benefit-box">
        <span class="benefit-metric">2–3 days</span>
        <strong>Fast</strong>
        <p>Versus 2–3 months with traditional shoots</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-box">
        <span class="benefit-metric">€19–35</span>
        <strong>Affordable</strong>
        <p>Per image, versus €500+ for traditional photography</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-box">
        <span class="benefit-metric">100%</span>
        <strong>Consistent</strong>
        <p>On-brand aesthetic guaranteed across all visuals</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-box">
        <span class="benefit-metric">Unlimited</span>
        <strong>Scalable</strong>
        <p>Generate as many variations as you need, instantly</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-card {
    background: #F8F9FA;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 44px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .step-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 82, 204, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-details {
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .step-details ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .step-details li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  /* Timeline Bar */
  .timeline-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .timeline-segment {
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .timeline-segment.active {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand-primary), var(--accent-success));
    animation: pulse-timeline 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse-timeline {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.7; }
  }

  .timeline-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: -28px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Benefits Grid */
  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .benefit-box {
    background: transparent;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 28px 4px 0;
    text-align: left;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .benefit-box:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-primary);
  }

  .benefit-metric {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .benefit-box strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .benefit-box p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .how-it-works {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .step-card {
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }

    .step-number {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .step-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .timeline-label {
      position: static;
      display: block;
      top: auto;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
